  "releaseNotes": "ADDED\n\t\t\t* Is().SameAs(obj) asserts that an object is the same reference\n\t\t\tFIXED\n\t\t\t* Drop the empty header before claims that sits right under the root folder\n\t\t\t* An index after 'that' is stated rather than dropped: that[0].Is(82) reads \"that [0] is 82\"\n\t\t\t* A call among other items keeps its shape: [Sum(1, 2), 3] no longer reads \"[sum 1, 2, 3]\"\n\t\t\t* A failing assertion after 'and' names what failed: \"Expected text to contain\", not \"Expected  to contain\"",
